[
    {
        "id": "device_watchdog_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "═══════════════ DEVICE WATCHDOG - Health Monitoring ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Device Watchdog - Health Monitoring\n\n**Flow Number:** 90\n**Domain:** Monitoring & Logging\n\n### Purpose\nMonitors device health via MQTT heartbeats and sends Telegram alerts when devices go offline.\n\n### Monitored Devices\n1. **Main Gate** (MainGate)\n   - Topic: MainGate/STAT/reccurentStatusRelay4\n   - Timeout: 3 minutes\n   - Alert: \"Main gate online/offline\"\n\n2. **Irrigation System** (IrigationSystem)\n   - Topic: tele/IrigationSystem/STATE\n   - Timeout: 11 minutes\n   - Alert: \"Irrigation system online/offline\"\n\n3. **Water Pump** (pompaApa)\n   - Topic: tele/pompaApa/STATE\n   - Timeout: 11 minutes\n   - Alert: \"Pump system online/offline\"\n\n### Features\n- Trigger-based timeout detection\n- Automatic Telegram notifications\n- Node-RED startup notification\n- Configurable timeout per device\n\n### Integration\n- Uses shared telegram_bot_config\n- Sends to chat ID: 991635368 (hardcoded)\n\n### Dependencies\n- telegram_bot_config (shared)\n- mqtt_broker_local\n- node-red-contrib-simpletime (timestamp formatting)\n\n### Note\nThis is a pure monitoring flow with NO UI components.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "watchdog_startup_inject",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Node-RED Startup",
        "props": [
            {
                "p": "payload"
            },
            {
                "p": "payload.chatId",
                "v": "991635368",
                "vt": "num"
            },
            {
                "p": "payload.type",
                "v": "message",
                "vt": "str"
            },
            {
                "p": "payload.content",
                "v": "",
                "vt": "date"
            }
        ],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": true,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "",
        "payload": "{}",
        "payloadType": "json",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 120,
        "wires": [
            ["watchdog_format_time"]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "watchdog_format_time",
        "type": "simpletime",
